Security notes
Never paste and run one-liner install commands you do not understand. Review any setup script before executing it.
Store API keys only in your local omniroute.yaml (gitignored).
Rotate any keys you may have accidentally exposed or committed.
If you expose the gateway remotely, put it behind an authenticated reverse proxy (such as Cloudflare Tunnel + Access) and never leave the port open to the public internet.
